{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86fac42d861c5cc0c6ae92c325fc5292bb65cfcde16df97e0783ed768cb8651",
      "text": "好嘞，这样关于歌舞伎的书就都在这里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d87cbf834c2e5d60e5d82f4efb60ea5ef9df28a2abe16b27a783875fada0cc",
      "text": "谢谢老师。\n一个人找实在太辛苦了，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:111f5ca72d8283226c205289e4db734ba20304764aad0b7c2e8deebebcba4135",
      "text": "毕竟那次社会实践之后对这个这么感兴趣的，\n全校就只有你一个啊。帮帮你也很有价值。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1980a43225fdeaef0abdb461f94adf3b86334afac6128695f78442fb4d97f302",
      "text": "我还是第一次见到那么美丽的景象。\n舞台上的一切都……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b5e9f936cfb6b306608ab01bf7039903d69ab080a492b035ac3cf00b9113e8",
      "text": "演员的一举手一投足都闪烁着光彩，\n仿佛连这双眼睛都在兴奋地呐喊着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:984d1451cf2fe3a824c672922fa64905eb344c0c5de93928e05cd80148aebc62",
      "text": "有特别喜欢的场景吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e007bce79226c9f5392fa24b7d41f4df4089692a7ac03ceec9245a1330e261",
      "text": "像这样迈出步子，\n或是大幅度地甩头……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7dd2e510b962f6dceda29c4c6795ecd0874f0ee6e6f2ab089a8e5cd3af45db0",
      "text": "那个就叫“亮相”对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5561be0ff8bcf7fa854b50e1ab37eac3166d3a1d5c1fa616c4bf191e17e6206b",
      "text": "噢！刚才那下挺有模有样的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c02222054ba2eb9b8c78b48b848e4cd4ef47936571eef018ebc09d2b4198d84b",
      "text": "要是表演给那些叫你“皇子”的女生们看，\n绝对会引起大轰动吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42a31b3869eca2b299bcc2c9d5f07279f6172396d3331cc7decd4b7c1b1cbcf5",
      "text": "哎…………我没兴趣呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ccc28bd04f16af0953a9e377bece25acc4503e997b97d096aeae776c2e3d7c2",
      "text": "（竟然能遇见如此美妙的世界）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4792c13cf8b943411c5e7e69e082b25297a8ab1d3ca02c9165a3fb94794d43ec",
      "text": "（我也好想站在那片光芒之中……！\n沐浴在耀眼的光芒下，美丽地绽放光彩！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
